  "engine_release": {
    "notes": "Engine maintenance release. Rebuilds the bundled Circle WASM with SQLite 3.53.4, carrying upstream fixes for problems in 3.53.0 through 3.53.3. Adds configurable CLI OU budgets for ordinary owner-signed SQL writes, new initializer SQL, restore batches, verify write-smoke, and upgrade write-smoke; adds receipt follow-up for already-submitted transactions; and includes nonce/OU metadata in submitted write results. The upgrade path was rehearsed on devnet and applied to the Octra Vitals mainnet Lab DB Circle before publish. OSR1/OSW1, owner-write authorization, storage accounting, execution budgets, root Rust entry points, and runtime dependencies remain unchanged from 0.6.2. The optional wasm-behavior harness dependency is patched to wasmtime 36.0.13."
  },
